sequenceDiagram
    %% SD6 - Maintain facility information
    %% Stories: 16, 40, 42, 43, 47, 49
    %% Description: An admin onboards recycling centers and adds or removes their information. Superusers and facility representatives keep it up to date, and the admin sends updates to the facilities.
    actor AD as Admin
    actor SU as Superuser
    actor RR as Facility representative
    participant RF as RecyclingFacility
    participant WT as WasteType

    %% covers 16, 40, 42
    AD->>RF: onboard center and add its information
    %% covers 43
    SU->>RF: update center information
    %% covers 49
    RR->>RF: update information and accepted materials
    RF->>WT: accepted waste types
    %% covers 16
    AD->>RF: remove outdated information
    %% covers 47
    AD->>RF: send updates to the facility
